# Only source, documents, configuration, and compact evidence belong in Git.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.pyx
!*.proto
!*.md
!*.rst
!*.json
!*.sh
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.cfg
!*.in
!*.patch
!*.diff
!*.csv
!*.exit
!requirements*.txt
!ENVIRONMENT*.txt
!CLEANUP_ALLOWLIST*.txt
!SHA256SUMS
!LICENSE*
!COPYING*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes

# Local authentication, compiled/generated files, datasets, raw predictions.
.claude/
.ssh/
.env*
